requirement SYS-001
title: Register vehicle identity
allocation: Vehicle manager
statement:
  The service shall register each accepted vehicle identity before mission use.
end requirement

requirement SYS-002
title: Maintain vehicle identity
allocation: Vehicle manager
statement:
  The service shall retain each registered vehicle identity until it is retired.
end requirement

requirement SYS-004
title: Flight-plan authorization binding
allocation: Flight-plan manager
statement:
  The service shall bind each approved flight plan to its authorizing decision.
end requirement

requirement SYS-012
title: Coordinate safe-recovery command
allocation: Ground-control adapter
statement:
  The service shall coordinate link detection and transmission of each safe-recovery command.
end requirement
